          "Products"
        ],
        "summary": "List products",
        "description": "Returns a page of products. `search` matches the name or description (case-insensitive), `minPrice`/`maxPrice` bound the price, and `sort` is one of `name` (default), `-name`, `price` or `-price`. `pageSize` is at most 100.",
